Noted, and I've written it down as your watch list for the meeting:

- anything touching **CSE455 office hours (Wed 11:20–13:00)** or the **quiz section (Wed 13:30–14:30, Thu 09:00–10:20)** — proposed changes, moves, or someone else taking over your coverage;
- any change to **grading deadlines**;
- and I'll flag these separately in the notes so they don't get buried.

Otherwise it's the usual: decisions, action points with owners and dates.

One small thing — your office hours and quiz-section times differ from what I have on my own Wednesday/Thursday (mine are office hours 14:20–15:40, quiz 15:40–17:00). I'll quote yours as you've given them here, and if the meeting discusses staff-wide times I'll note the difference so we don't end up with a mix-up. I'll send the notes Wednesday after the meeting.
